        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"dt-reviews-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"dt-reviews-heading\">\n    Loved by <span class=\"dt-highlight\">120,000+ pet parents</span>\n  </h2>\n  <div class=\"dt-reviews-grid\">\n    <div class=\"dt-review-card\">\n      <div class=\"dt-review-header\">\n        <span class=\"dt-review-name\">Karim, Rocky's owner</span>\n        <span class=\"dt-review-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"dt-review-text\">\"Rocky hates having his teeth brushed, so this was a lifesaver. Two quick sprays a day and his breath is so much better. After a few weeks the yellow buildup on his back teeth looks noticeably lighter.\"</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dt-review-card\">\n      <div class=\"dt-review-header\">\n        <span class=\"dt-review-name\">Rita, Mishmish's owner</span>\n        <span class=\"dt-review-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"dt-review-text\">\"Getting anything near my cat's mouth is usually a battle. The spray is quick and she barely notices it. Her breath doesn't knock me over anymore when she sleeps next to me.\"</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dt-review-card\">\n      <div class=\"dt-review-header\">\n        <span class=\"dt-review-name\">Elie, Bella's owner</span>\n        <span class=\"dt-review-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"dt-review-text\">\"Our vet mentioned tartar starting to build up on Bella's teeth. We've been using this daily for a month and at her last checkup the vet said her teeth were looking cleaner. Easy win.\"</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"dt-review-card\">\n      <div class=\"dt-review-header\">\n        <span class=\"dt-review-name\">Joelle, Simba & Luna's owner</span>\n        <span class=\"dt-review-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"dt-review-text\">\"I have a dog and a cat, and it works for both, which is so convenient. No mess, no fuss, and one bottle lasts ages. Both of them have fresher breath and I finally feel on top of their dental care.\"</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<style>\n  .dt-reviews-section {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    padding: 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 100vw;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n  }\n  .dt-reviews-section * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .dt-reviews-heading {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0 0 30px 0;\n  }\n  .dt-highlight {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4caf50, #1b5e20);\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .dt-reviews-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 16px;\n    max-width: 1400px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n  .dt-review-card {\n    background: #eef8ec;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n  .dt-review-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .dt-review-name {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  .dt-review-stars {\n    color: #2e7d32;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .dt-review-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0;\n    overflow-wrap: break-word;\n    word-break: break-word;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .dt-reviews-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .dt-reviews-heading {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n    .dt-reviews-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n    .dt-review-card {\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n    .dt-review-name {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .dt-review-text {\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
